      "text": "Step 5: Use the\nmethods\n\nprepare_grayscale ->\nchecks the launch\nshape\n\ngrayscale ->\nqueues the kernel",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Step 5: Use the\nmethods\n\nprepare_grayscale ->\nchecks the launch\nshape\n\ngrayscale ->\nqueues the kernel",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "zdDqu28JriG9GdDtNAemI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1090.5701293945312,
      "y": 633.5,
      "width": 508.8597412109375,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aQ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 184449918,
      "version": 237,
      "versionNonce": 1219039038,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792500340930,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Load does two things:\n\n1. It hands the PTX to the driver, which compiles it\nand loads the result onto the GPU.\n\n2. It returns `module`, our handle (reference) \nto that loaded code. Launches go through it.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Load does two things:\n\n1. It hands the PTX to the driver, which compiles it\nand loads the result onto the GPU.\n\n2. It returns `module`, our handle (reference) \nto that loaded code. Launches go through it.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
